{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_107_title", "source_sha256": "772f379e6d715e2074c4af0e8795c416fe55b9ff81885924be228b0555fd1ff6", "ja": "星を見つけて", "zh": "找到繁星", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_107_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b88b8b7952490515f9522d05079d2ce2ceb692235c0614b0054b83b7040f1216", "ja": "『アイグラ！！』のアンケートをきっかけに\n夢について考えるジュリア。そんな時元いた\nバンドが解散するかもしれないと聞き、\n劇場に立って新曲を披露。今の自分の夢と、\n皆にも夢を諦めてほしくないことを伝える。", "zh": "以《偶图！！》的问卷为契机，\n茱莉亚开始思考起了梦想。此时她听说\n曾经所属的乐队可能会解散，便登上剧场\n的舞台表演了新曲。向大家传达了自己如今的梦想，\n以及希望大家也不要放弃梦想的心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_107_1000_null", "source_sha256": "abaf9c8e0b7588a2176c7b14f10e0dee726abb070e87d3b4c961e03e83a4bd7a", "ja": "公演終了後……", "zh": "演出结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_107_1001_yuma", "source_sha256": "93571662a94d11987a8760c7407e3e8ff4fa7db4bdd86c2346ad8fe9751632e9", "ja": "あっ……来た！\nジュリアさ～ん！　こっちこっち！", "zh": "啊……来了！\n茱莉亚先生～！这边这边！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_107_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "b0d441d2e303c656027ce359931b4631020139723795cbb5ccf2c472505edf3c", "ja": "なんだよお前ら、わざわざ待ってたのか？\n先に帰ってもよかったのに……。", "zh": "你们干什么啊，居然还特意等着我？\n明明可以先回去的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_107_1003_sara", "source_sha256": "97283b48e6f153b1503080a200bde1193e1ac878563b358cfa7388fc965681b2", "ja": "はぁ……相変わらず素直じゃないなぁ。\nホントはうれしいくせに。", "zh": "唉……还是一如既往地不坦率啊。\n明明心里很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_107_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "427b7014044a6a63400947400f0af98bacabde514f642cdfa75fc35f8fcbd122", "ja": "べ、別に、そんなことは……。\nって、ヒロ！？　お前、何泣いてるんだよ！", "zh": "别、别的，才没有那回事……  \n等等，希罗！？你哭什么啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_107_1005_hiro", "source_sha256": "631986ac7e0e8d987d653498b30626f72e772a97ed064ea78bf86d04be7674d8", "ja": "よかったっス……\nジュリアさんの曲、めちゃめちゃよかったっス！", "zh": "太好了……\n茱莉亚的曲子，真的超级棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_107_1006_hiro", "source_sha256": "a5ff86c9c4f0eb10991e189cb5e5537240b812978641a093a8e24ec1b28523a4", "ja": "オレ、アイドルのこと全然詳しくないですけど。\n今日のライブ、マジでよかったっス……。", "zh": "我对偶像完全不了解。\n不过今天的演唱会真的很棒……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_107_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "7280f393cc1dce49afd6a659ddf7e145c69184179ed57dd0bae761dd1ca6a846", "ja": "ヒロ……。\nありがとな。", "zh": "小广……\n谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_107_1008_sara", "source_sha256": "b518cf23fb67dbb9c8b9a2f2bc1f8d151fd7b447d8c0485b8acf235b475ba5c6", "ja": "ホント、ジュリアがあんな素直な歌詞を歌うなんて、\n一緒にやってた頃じゃ考えられないよね～。", "zh": "真的，没想到茱莉亚会唱那么坦率的歌词，\n在一起合作的时候简直难以想象呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_107_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "0d2e0a636c12ee6b29d02a29380cac135845fa6691f8bae572dfa9ebf16dadbe", "ja": "ううう、うるさい！", "zh": "呜呜呜，吵死了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_107_1010_sara", "source_sha256": "4aabcd8ea6622dc94c4bcf50e95aac8ed096105b0a04ebfedec2f71a0319a6a3", "ja": "……ま、でもお陰で、目が覚めたよ。\nな、みんな！", "zh": "……不过，也多亏了这样，让我清醒过来了。\n对吧，大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_107_1011_yuma", "source_sha256": "d879049eb8c5c259d04efb7116a67778c1965f17bb6b6f2a6a108c3937c7b06e", "ja": "はい！　……ジュリアさん。僕達、諦めません！", "zh": "是！……茱莉亚先生。我们不会放弃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_107_1012_yuma", "source_sha256": "575f27424f72bcb46d4761357117de059e0cdf2545e95a10d6754d4491f37ac4", "ja": "無理かもしれんけど……。ばってん、\n僕達にだって、まだやれることがあるはずばい！", "zh": "虽然可能做不到……但是，我们应该也还有能做的事才对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_107_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "0b9cec53b54c92264ee4ba4e4fefbc9f91aa2a8e8e8fd9f7f41b844a2150beea", "ja": "お前ら……。", "zh": "你们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_107_1014_hiro", "source_sha256": "2912db02a37b73c4077ef17e26e7d44dc4af8e6084ba690aaf15b08093a959c0", "ja": "いつか共演しようぜ、ジュリアさん。その時はオレ達が\nジュリアさんのバックで、今日の曲を演奏してやるよ！", "zh": "改天一起同台演出吧，茱莉亚。到时候就由我们\n在茱莉亚背后，为今天的曲子伴奏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_107_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "d328c7445efa1ff67448d94d9a1239fa7731a01b374f360d3c0189290cf0fc8a", "ja": "……ああ！　楽しみにしてるからな！", "zh": "……啊！我会期待着的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_107_1016_p", "source_sha256": "27dc8b35ca4c812e33711fc48630bdd7f59f056cda641aa6fbf21285d8bca160", "ja": "（『きっと、いつか』。その願いを抱いて走るのは、\nアイドルでもバンドでも、同じこと……）", "zh": "（“总有一天，一定会实现”。无论是偶像还是乐队，怀抱着这份愿望不断奔跑，都是一样的……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_107_1017_p", "source_sha256": "376a3f1aa25114db3705a0e3fd3d7c16a99319801554a291ce6acd6591a25043", "ja": "（なら俺は俺として、その背中を支え続けるだけだ。\n彼らの願いが叶う、その日、その瞬間まで！）", "zh": "（那么我就以我自己的方式，继续支撑着他们的背影。直到他们的愿望实现的那一天、那一刻为止！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
